): A:88,5 x L:36,6 x P:43,5cm', 730.09, 610.11, NULL, 'Home & Living > Furniture > Desks & Tables', 'https://cf.shopee.com.br/file/sg-11134201-825as-mfy9961b3yfgd8', 'https://shope.ee/an_redir?origin_link=https%3A%2F%2Fshopee.com.br%2Fproduct%2F855489892%2F20597673920', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-28T02:11:31.708458+00:00');
