Sports & Outdoor Recreation Equipments > Swimming & Diving', 'https://cf.shopee.com.br/file/sg-11134201-7rd5f-m7m9p8k99ixgd2', 'https://shope.ee/an_redir?origin_link=https%3A%2F%2Fshopee.com.br%2Fproduct%2F429366971%2F23793840211', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-28T02:11:31.708458+00:00');
