 smooth, clean and refreshed How to use After cleaning the skin, apply an appropriate amount of gel and gently massage the skin until it appears something similar to keratin debris, then rinse it with water. Package includes: 1*Chamomile Scrub Gel', 45.0, 34.29, NULL, 'Beauty > Skincare > Face Scrub & Peel', 'https://cf.shopee.com.br/file/7f9838fc8b76d74b1c1c38f6a4f1ca69', 'https://shope.ee/an_redir?origin_link=https%3A%2F%2Fshopee.com.br%2Fproduct%2F250961519%2F9515811056', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-28T02:11:31.708458+00:00');
